# --- Tauri / Capacitor (Phase 4) ---
# Rust build artifacts.
src-tauri/target/
# Capacitor `cap add ios|android` generates these inside `frontend/`. The
# source-of-truth native plugin code lives under `native-plugins/`, which
# we keep tracked — hence the anchored path.
frontend/ios/
frontend/android/

